Codex Usage Indicator for Zeus OS

This GNOME Shell extension is adapted from:
  https://github.com/radoslavdodek/codex-usage-gnome-shell-ext
  commit 22baeaef5bc4642851148c99b505cb6469679199

The upstream work is Copyright (C) Radoslav Dodek and is licensed under the
GNU Affero General Public License, version 3.  This adapted extension remains
AGPL-3.0-covered; see LICENSE and image/licenses/codex-usage/README.md.

Zeus modifications (2026): fixed the provider to /usr/bin/codex app-server
stdio, removed configurable settings/mock data and CLI-output parsing, added
bounded JSON-RPC transport and redacted failures, and added the ChatGPT
device-code menu flow with cancel support and an exact OpenAI verification URL
guard. The protocol follows the official Codex app-server account/login/start,
account/login/cancel, account/login/completed, and account/rateLimits/read
interface documented at:
  https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/main/codex-rs/app-server/README.md
